<title>UK: London gold closes softer, but off day's lows.</title>
<headline>London gold closes softer, but off day's lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Ends at $342.40/342.90, versus $343.80/344.30 on Wednesday. Holds on above support despite test of $342 area. Generally quiet.</p>
<p>SILVER - Closes at $4.75/4.77, down one cent.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ends $15 easier at $440.00/450.00. Drifts lower amid</p>
<p>very thin volumes. Some lending emerges.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finishes easier at $208.00/$213.00, down $6.</p>
</text>
